<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 75 bln levs 4-wk T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 75 bln levs 4-wk T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer five issues of four-week discount T-bills worth a total of 75 billion levs at daily auctions this week, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with a maximum par of 15 billion levs each and no minimum acceptable price set in advance, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER     AUCTION DATE    ISSUE DATE    MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3039097004	 June 16	   June 17	 July 15</p>
<p> BG3039197002	 June 17	   June 18	 July 16</p>
<p> BG3039297000	 June 18	   June 19	 July 17</p>
<p> BG3039397008	 June 19	   June 20	 July 18</p>
<p> BG3039497006	 June 20	   June 23	 July 21</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
